    "text": "<p>The cell potential for the following cell&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Pt</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mfenced open=\"\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.01</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>Cu</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>576</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>. The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi></math> of the solution is (Nearest integer)</p><p>(Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Cu</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi>RT</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>06</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>)</p>"
  },
